        "description": "Detection of characteristic curvilinear bodies in skin or conjunctival biopsy",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of biallelic pathogenic TPP1 mutations or confirmed enzyme deficiency combined with compatible clinical presentation",
    "notes": "Early diagnosis is critical for potential enzyme replacement therapy."
